      "content": "im just really busy work wise and i cant really get to the doctor right now without taking a whole day off. plus i already have some ibuprofen and some old prescription stuff in my cabinet. would it be okay if i just took a higher dose of the ibuprofen to see if the swelling goes down? maybe like 1000mg every few hours?",
